('0559775001', '0559775', 'Shane padded', 'Hoodie', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Jacket Casual', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Mens Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded jacket in woven fabric with a sheen. Lined drawstring hood, zip down the front, side pockets with a concealed hook and loop fastening and one inner pocket. Ribbing at the cuffs and hem and a quilted lining in a contrasting colour. Polyester filling.', NULL, 0, 0),
