('0565243001', '0565243', 'VANJA romper', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Dungarees in soft, organic cotton twill with frill-trimmed straps that cross at the back and fasten at the front. Elastication at the back of the waist and heart-shaped patch front pockets. Concealed press-studs at the crotch and legs, and ribbed hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0565251001', '0565251', 'LITTLE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a top and trousers in soft cotton. Top with print stripes, buttons on the shoulders, ribbing at the neckline and cuffs, and a rounded hem. Trousers with elasticated ribbing at the waist, fake front pockets, a fake back pocket and sewn-in turn-ups at the hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0565258002', '0565258', 'ADA dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Chambray', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a long-sleeved jersey bodysuit and dress in organic cotton. Patterned bodysuit with a concealed press-stud on both shoulders. Dress in soft chambray with frills, shoulder straps that cross and fasten at the back, and elastication at the back of the waist. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
