('0567435001', '0567435', 'Winston clutch', 'Bag', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Small Bags', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Big accessories', 'Accessories', 'Rectangular clutch bag in sturdy satin with a zipped inner compartment. Flap with a magnetic fastener, wrist strap decorated with sparkly stones and a narrow, detachable shoulder strap. Lined. Size 4.5x11x27 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567438005', '0567438', 'Clark Slim Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in marled Italian wool with stitching details. Concealed button and hook-and-eye fastening, zip fly, side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567438006', '0567438', 'Clark Slim Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in marled Italian wool with stitching details. Concealed button and hook-and-eye fastening, zip fly, side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567438007', '0567438', 'Clark Slim Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Grey', 'Medium Dusty', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in marled Italian wool with stitching details. Concealed button and hook-and-eye fastening, zip fly, side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567438008', '0567438', 'Clark Slim Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in marled Italian wool with stitching details. Concealed button and hook-and-eye fastening, zip fly, side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567439002', '0567439', 'Clark Skinny Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a stretch wool weave with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener and zip fly. Diagonal side pockets and jetted back pockets with a button. Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567439006', '0567439', 'Clark Skinny Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a stretch wool weave with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener and zip fly. Diagonal side pockets and jetted back pockets with a button. Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567441003', '0567441', 'Manfred  Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in a wool and linen weave with an extended waistband, concealed hook-and-eye fastening and zip fly. Side pockets, flap back pockets with a button, and legs with creases, turn-ups and kick tape at the hems. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567442001', '0567442', 'Andy check Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Check', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Checked suit trousers in a stretch weave. Extended waistband with concealed hook-and-eye fasteners, and a zip fly and button. Diagonal side pockets, jetted back pockets with a button, and legs with creases Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0567443001', '0567443', 'Brago Summer Cropped Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Marled suit trousers woven in a wool blend with an extended waistband with a button and concealed hook-and-eye fastener. Zip fly, pockets in the side seams, welt back pockets with a button and slightly shorter legs with creases. Slim fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
