('0570233001', '0570233', 'Mike Skinny Trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Denim wardrobe H&M man inactive from S.6', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Other 2', 'Unknown', 'Suit trousers in woven fabric with a sheen. Concealed hook-and-eye fastener, a zip fly, side pockets and jetted back pockets. Skinny fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
