('0570240003', '0570240', 'Vincent light Blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Denim wardrobe H&M man inactive from S.6', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Other 2', 'Unknown', 'Single-breasted jacket in a linen and cotton weave with narrow notch lapels, two buttons at the front and decorative buttons at the cuffs. Chest pocket with a contrasting colour lining, welt front pockets with a flap and two inner pockets. Single back vent. Half-lined. Slim fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
